    "model_prompt": "I'm working on a {{Programming Language}} project and need your assistance during the implementation of a specific feature. Please hold the following story description as the context. For now, you don't need to provide any suggested code. Here is the story description:\n\n---\n\n**PT Story**\n**Title:** {{Story Title}}\n\n**Description:**\n{{Story Description}}\n**End of PT Story**\n\n---\n\nHere are some guidelines for our collaboration:\n\n1. If your answer includes multiple steps, provide a list of steps for me to review first. Proceed to the next step only after I confirm.\n2. Present one suggested step at a time. Move to the next step only after I have reviewed and confirmed the current step.\n3. Show only the relevant code changes needed; avoid displaying the entire file unless necessary.\n\n---\n\nPlease follow these steps:\n\n1. Simply request me to provide any relevant code files and content related to this feature, you can provide some suggestion\n2. Ask clarifying questions if any part of the story description or the relevant code content is unclear.\n3. If everything is good to go, begin the collaborative session based on the provided information.",
